{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"github-actions-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"GitHub Actions Snippets","description":"Workflows, language jobs, build matrices, caches, secrets, release and deploy steps for GitHub Actions.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"YAML","path":"snippets/yaml.json"},{"language":"Config","path":"snippets/config.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/yaml.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Workflow\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gha\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"name: ${1:CI}\",\n      \"on:\",\n      \"  push:\",\n      \"    branches: [main]\",\n      \"  pull_request:\",\n      \"jobs:\",\n      \"  build:\",\n      \"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"    steps:\",\n      \"      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"      - run: ${2:echo hello}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A CI workflow\"\n  },\n  \"Node job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghanode\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\",\n      \"      with:\",\n      \"        node-version: ${1:22}\",\n      \"        cache: npm\",\n      \"    - run: npm ci\",\n      \"    - run: npm test\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Node.js test job\"\n  },\n  \"Python job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghapy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\",\n      \"      with:\",\n      \"        python-version: \\\"${1:3.12}\\\"\",\n      \"        cache: pip\",\n      \"    - run: pip install -r requirements.txt\",\n      \"    - run: pytest\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Python test job\"\n  },\n  \"Rust job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gharust\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\",\n      \"    - uses: swatinem/rust-cache@v2\",\n      \"    - run: cargo test\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Rust test job\"\n  },\n  \"Matrix\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghamatrix\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"strategy:\",\n      \"  fail-fast: false\",\n      \"  matrix:\",\n      \"    os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest]\",\n      \"    ${1:node}: [${2:20, 22}]\",\n      \"runs-on: \\\\${{ matrix.os }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A build matrix\"\n  },\n  \"Release on tag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gharelease\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"on:\",\n      \"  push:\",\n      \"    tags: [\\\"v*\\\"]\",\n      \"permissions:\",\n      \"  contents: write\",\n      \"jobs:\",\n      \"  release:\",\n      \"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"    steps:\",\n      \"      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"      - run: ${1:make dist}\",\n      \"      - uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\",\n      \"        with:\",\n      \"          files: ${2:dist/*}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Publish a release when a tag is pushed\"\n  },\n  \"Cache\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghacache\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"- uses: actions/cache@v4\",\n      \"  with:\",\n      \"    path: ${1:~/.cache}\",\n      \"    key: \\\\${{ runner.os }}-${2:name}-\\\\${{ hashFiles('${3:**/lockfile}') }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A cache step\"\n  },\n  \"Secret\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghasecret\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"env:\",\n      \"  ${1:TOKEN}: \\\\${{ secrets.${1:TOKEN} }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use a secret\"\n  },\n  \"Deploy over SSH\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghassh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"- run: |\",\n      \"    mkdir -p ~/.ssh\",\n      \"    echo \\\"\\\\${{ secrets.DEPLOY_KEY }}\\\" > ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\",\n      \"    chmod 600 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\",\n      \"    rsync -az -e \\\"ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new\\\" ${1:dist/} ${2:user@host}:${3:/var/www/app}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Deploy with rsync over SSH\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/config.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Workflow\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gha\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"name: ${1:CI}\",\n      \"on:\",\n      \"  push:\",\n      \"    branches: [main]\",\n      \"  pull_request:\",\n      \"jobs:\",\n      \"  build:\",\n      \"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"    steps:\",\n      \"      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"      - run: ${2:echo hello}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A CI workflow\"\n  },\n  \"Node job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghanode\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\",\n      \"      with:\",\n      \"        node-version: ${1:22}\",\n      \"        cache: npm\",\n      \"    - run: npm ci\",\n      \"    - run: npm test\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Node.js test job\"\n  },\n  \"Python job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghapy\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\",\n      \"      with:\",\n      \"        python-version: \\\"${1:3.12}\\\"\",\n      \"        cache: pip\",\n      \"    - run: pip install -r requirements.txt\",\n      \"    - run: pytest\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Python test job\"\n  },\n  \"Rust job\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gharust\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test:\",\n      \"  runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"  steps:\",\n      \"    - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"    - uses: dtolnay/rust-toolchain@stable\",\n      \"    - uses: swatinem/rust-cache@v2\",\n      \"    - run: cargo test\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Rust test job\"\n  },\n  \"Matrix\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghamatrix\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"strategy:\",\n      \"  fail-fast: false\",\n      \"  matrix:\",\n      \"    os: [ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest]\",\n      \"    ${1:node}: [${2:20, 22}]\",\n      \"runs-on: \\\\${{ matrix.os }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A build matrix\"\n  },\n  \"Release on tag\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"gharelease\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"on:\",\n      \"  push:\",\n      \"    tags: [\\\"v*\\\"]\",\n      \"permissions:\",\n      \"  contents: write\",\n      \"jobs:\",\n      \"  release:\",\n      \"    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\",\n      \"    steps:\",\n      \"      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\",\n      \"      - run: ${1:make dist}\",\n      \"      - uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\",\n      \"        with:\",\n      \"          files: ${2:dist/*}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Publish a release when a tag is pushed\"\n  },\n  \"Cache\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghacache\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"- uses: actions/cache@v4\",\n      \"  with:\",\n      \"    path: ${1:~/.cache}\",\n      \"    key: \\\\${{ runner.os }}-${2:name}-\\\\${{ hashFiles('${3:**/lockfile}') }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A cache step\"\n  },\n  \"Secret\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghasecret\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"env:\",\n      \"  ${1:TOKEN}: \\\\${{ secrets.${1:TOKEN} }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Use a secret\"\n  },\n  \"Deploy over SSH\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ghassh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"- run: |\",\n      \"    mkdir -p ~/.ssh\",\n      \"    echo \\\"\\\\${{ secrets.DEPLOY_KEY }}\\\" > ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\",\n      \"    chmod 600 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519\",\n      \"    rsync -az -e \\\"ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=accept-new\\\" ${1:dist/} ${2:user@host}:${3:/var/www/app}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Deploy with rsync over SSH\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# GitHub Actions Snippets\n\nWorkflows, language jobs, build matrices, caches, secrets, release and deploy steps for GitHub Actions.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 18 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| YAML | `gha` | A CI workflow |\n| YAML | `ghanode` | A Node.js test job |\n| YAML | `ghapy` | A Python test job |\n| YAML | `gharust` | A Rust test job |\n| YAML | `ghamatrix` | A build matrix |\n| YAML | `gharelease` | Publish a release when a tag is pushed |\n| YAML | `ghacache` | A cache step |\n| YAML | `ghasecret` | Use a secret |\n| YAML | `ghassh` | Deploy with rsync over SSH |\n| Config | `gha` | A CI workflow |\n| Config | `ghanode` | A Node.js test job |\n| Config | `ghapy` | A Python test job |\n| Config | `gharust` | A Rust test job |\n| Config | `ghamatrix` | A build matrix |\n| Config | `gharelease` | Publish a release when a tag is pushed |\n| Config | `ghacache` | A cache step |\n| Config | `ghasecret` | Use a secret |\n| Config | `ghassh` | Deploy with rsync over SSH |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}